{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Pocket Racer Shop Sim</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build. Customize. Race. Collect.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket Racer Shop Sim is a cozy shop simulator with a racing twist. Run your dream shop, unlock booster packs filled with parts, and build pocket-sized machines to put on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/fa5cc9e06a3c6d4a617391c5ea0f9eee.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/fa5cc9e06a3c6d4a617391c5ea0f9eee.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/fa5cc9e06a3c6d4a617391c5ea0f9eee.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Design Your Shop:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate, rearrange, and shape the vibe of your store \u2014 from furniture and shelving to lighting, and wall colors. Build a space that feels uniquely yours and watch customers respond to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/b9442c49b517646839c0c701de0efc81.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/b9442c49b517646839c0c701de0efc81.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/b9442c49b517646839c0c701de0efc81.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Collect Parts:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open booster packs to discover motors, gears, wheels, bodies, stabilizers, batteries, cosmetics, and more. Grow your inventory, chase rare finds, and assemble the ultimate collection of performance and style options. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/6ce95464276bf67828493080419d0322.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/6ce95464276bf67828493080419d0322.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/6ce95464276bf67828493080419d0322.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build &amp; Tune Your Racer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix motors, gears, wheels, bodies, and more to craft the perfect pocket-sized machine. Fine-tune your setup at the Workbench to dial in its stats based on each track\u2019s demands. Every adjustment affects performance, rewarding clever experimentation and smart engineering. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/e87c733697f71c957371c153b3c90a53.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/e87c733697f71c957371c153b3c90a53.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/e87c733697f71c957371c153b3c90a53.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race, Progress, &amp; Unlock New Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your builds to the test on your shop\u2019s track and challenge customers or friends to races. As your shop grows, you\u2019ll unlock new tracks to race on, host events, and refine your setups around increasingly complex layouts. Share the excitement by exploring or racing on community-made tracks with planned Steam Workshop support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1341dd24fcdb2b840c513c31dbd2c7a3.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1341dd24fcdb2b840c513c31dbd2c7a3.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1341dd24fcdb2b840c513c31dbd2c7a3.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your creativity run wild by designing race circuits of your own. With planned Workshop integration, you\u2019ll be able to share your creations, download player-made tracks, and keep your racing scene endlessly fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/83f3e7c8eacf99df679cad4b0229ce01.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/83f3e7c8eacf99df679cad4b0229ce01.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/83f3e7c8eacf99df679cad4b0229ce01.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to your shop or go visit theirs where you can buy parts, check out shop designs, or join in a race.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982690?t=1768838558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982690?t=1768838558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/45918abbb02008d0427bb197cc006c0e3cf957cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768838558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/45918abbb02008d0427bb197cc006c0e3cf957cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768838558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Pocket Racer Shop Sim</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build. Customize. Race. Collect.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket Racer Shop Sim is a cozy shop simulator with a racing twist. Run your dream shop, unlock booster packs filled with parts, and build pocket-sized machines to put on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/fa5cc9e06a3c6d4a617391c5ea0f9eee.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/fa5cc9e06a3c6d4a617391c5ea0f9eee.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/fa5cc9e06a3c6d4a617391c5ea0f9eee.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Design Your Shop:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate, rearrange, and shape the vibe of your store \u2014 from furniture and shelving to lighting, and wall colors. Build a space that feels uniquely yours and watch customers respond to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/b9442c49b517646839c0c701de0efc81.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/b9442c49b517646839c0c701de0efc81.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/b9442c49b517646839c0c701de0efc81.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Collect Parts:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open booster packs to discover motors, gears, wheels, bodies, stabilizers, batteries, cosmetics, and more. Grow your inventory, chase rare finds, and assemble the ultimate collection of performance and style options. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/6ce95464276bf67828493080419d0322.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/6ce95464276bf67828493080419d0322.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/6ce95464276bf67828493080419d0322.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build &amp; Tune Your Racer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix motors, gears, wheels, bodies, and more to craft the perfect pocket-sized machine. Fine-tune your setup at the Workbench to dial in its stats based on each track\u2019s demands. Every adjustment affects performance, rewarding clever experimentation and smart engineering. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/e87c733697f71c957371c153b3c90a53.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/e87c733697f71c957371c153b3c90a53.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/e87c733697f71c957371c153b3c90a53.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race, Progress, &amp; Unlock New Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your builds to the test on your shop\u2019s track and challenge customers or friends to races. As your shop grows, you\u2019ll unlock new tracks to race on, host events, and refine your setups around increasingly complex layouts. Share the excitement by exploring or racing on community-made tracks with planned Steam Workshop support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1341dd24fcdb2b840c513c31dbd2c7a3.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1341dd24fcdb2b840c513c31dbd2c7a3.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1341dd24fcdb2b840c513c31dbd2c7a3.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your creativity run wild by designing race circuits of your own. With planned Workshop integration, you\u2019ll be able to share your creations, download player-made tracks, and keep your racing scene endlessly fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/83f3e7c8eacf99df679cad4b0229ce01.poster.avif?t=1768838558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/83f3e7c8eacf99df679cad4b0229ce01.webm?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/83f3e7c8eacf99df679cad4b0229ce01.mp4?t=1768838558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to your shop or go visit theirs where you can buy parts, check out shop designs, or join in a race.</p>","developers":["That One Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/fb0c673fe26e0de977154aaa72437f0c0e790f8b/header.jpg?t=1768838558","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3982690/1407056679/1a26e7a70e7ffcbae84bbe32e8d9ed2a2f32b44f/1765928795/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765932093","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3982690/1407056679/1a26e7a70e7ffcbae84bbe32e8d9ed2a2f32b44f/1765928795/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765932093","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic